  <text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
    <body>

        <div xml:id="AN261.1-kilavi">
          <p type="edition">puṇarntuṭaṉpōyiṉakālai iṭaiccurattup¬paṭṭataṉai mīṇṭuvantakālattut tōḻikkut talaimakaḷ  colliyatu.</p>
          <p type="translation" xml:lang="en">What SHE said to the confidante at the time she came [back], bringing back what had happened in the desert at the time she was eloping [with him] after having united.</p>
        </div>
        <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="AN261.1">
        <l>kāṉap pātirik karuntakaṭ ṭoḷvī</l>
        <l>vēṉi la<supplied>ti</supplied>raloṭu viraiik kāṇvarac</l>
        <l>cillaik kūnta laḻutti melliṇart</l>
        <l>tēmpāy marā<supplied>a</supplied> maṭaicci vāṉkō</l>
        <l>lilaṅkuvaḷait teḷirppa vīcic cilampunakac</l>
        <l>ciṉmel lotukkamoṭu meṉmela viyaliniṉ</l>
        <l>ṉaṇimāṇ ciṟupuṟaṅ kāṇkañ ciṟunaṉi</l>
        <l>yēkeṉa vēka ṉāṇi yeyyeṉa</l>
        <l>māko ṇōkkamoṭu maṭaṅkoḷac cāay</l>
        <l>niṉṟutalai yi<supplied>ṟai</supplied>ñci yōḷē yatukaṇ</l>
        <l>ṭiyāmun tuṟutal cellō māyiṭai</l>
        <l>yaruñcurat talki yēmē yirumpuli</l>
        <l>kaḷiṟaṭṭu kaḻumu mōcaiyuṅ kaḷipaṭṭu</l>
        <l>villōr kuṟumpiṟ ṟatumpum</l>
        <l>valvāyk kaṭuttuṭip pāṇiyuṅ kēṭṭē.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg type="translation" xml:lang="en">
        <l>When [she] mixed the bright blossoms with black outer petals</l>
        <l corresp="1f">of the forest trumpet tree with wild summer jasmine [and] visibly</l>
        <l>inlaid [her] fine wonderful tresses [with them], inserting</l>
        <l corresp="3-4c">nectar-flowing Kadamba in soft clusters, flinging [her arms]</l>
        <l corresp="4d-5">so that [her] shining bangles of divine beauty sparkled, [and], so that [her] anklets tinkled,</l>
        <l corresp="6">advanced very softly with a few short steps,</l>
        <l corresp="7a-c">[and I] said “let us see the small of your back, glorious with decoration,</l>
        <l>go a little [further] ,” hesitant to go she innocently reclined,</l>
        <l corresp="7d-9">with the arrow-like glance taken from a deer,</l>
        <l corresp="10">stood [still and] bowed [her] head; seeing that,</l>
        <l>we did not go [further] so that I was in front [but] stayed</l>
        <l corresp="11-12c">in between, in the difficult desert,</l>
        <l corresp="15d">– hearing [both]</l>
        <l corresp="12d-13c">the full sound of a big tiger killing an elephant</l>
        <l rend="indent2" corresp="15a-c">[and] the beat of the strong-mouthed fierce hourglass drum</l>
        <l corresp="13d-14">that resounds intoxicatedly from the stronghold of the bow men.</l>
      </lg>
        </div>
    </body>
  </text>

